# $_ in func position does NOT trigger WRAP-CALL (func position excluded).
# [call $_ $x] has $_ only in func position → no lambda wrapping.
# We verify by calling it: provide $_ as a bound function via explicit fn.
# [fn [_] [call $_ 99]] passes identity, which calls identity(99) = 99.
[call [fn [_] [_ 99]] [fn [x] x]]
===
Int(99)
